强对退函原因的 统计分析，以持续提升函证工作的规范化水平和效率。", "score": 0.9223076923076923, "rerank_score": 0.9223076923076923, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "bank_reply_time_limit_requirement", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "银行业金融机构回函的时限要求", "exact_support_score": 0.8462}}]}
