； （七）有与业务经营相适应的营业场所、安全防范措施和其他设施；", "score": 0.9247368421052632, "rerank_score": 0.9247368421052632, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "consumption_finance_registered_capital_requirement", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "申请设立消费金融公司注册资本最低限额要求", "exact_support_score": 0.8947}}]}
