消费金融公司开展互联网贷款业务，应当遵守互联网贷款有关法律法规和监管规定。", "score": 0.9165384615384615, "rerank_score": 0.9165384615384615, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "single_borrower_credit_limit_regulation", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "消费金融公司向单一借款人发放消费贷款的授信额度上限规定", "exact_support_score": 0.7308}}]}
