发行相应数量的普通股。", "score": 0.9168421052631579, "rerank_score": 0.8668421052631579, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "expanded_context", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "capital_tool_loss_absorption_order"}}]}
