，确保持续提供服务，或按计划有序关闭。", "score": 0.9163636363636364, "rerank_score": 0.9163636363636364, "chunk_type": "paragraph", "evidence_role": "bounded_lexical_support", "metadata": {"aspect_id": "core_business_line_definition", "fusion_method": "bounded_document_lexical_support", "exact_support_anchor": "核心业务条线是指恢复计划", "exact_support_score": 0.7273}}]}
